Git and GitHub Workflow
------------------------

Round 1

1. Create a new local repository ( One time )

git init

2. Provide User info to git repo (One time)

git config --global user.name "your name"
git config --global user.email "your email"

3. git status (for status checking)

4. Adding files/floders to stagging/indexing

git add -A (Add all files and floders to stagging)
git add filename
git add *.java
git add flodername

5. Commit the code into Local(git) repository

git commit -m "commit message"

6. connet local repository with remote repository (One Time)
 
 git remote add origin "url"
 
 7.  Push the code into remote repository
 
 git push origin master
 
 Pull files from remote repository
 -------------------------------------
 
 git pull "remote URL"
 
 clone new repository to local system
 ---------------------------------------
 
 git clone "remote URL"
